    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 8th level, the envoy becomes immune to effects that would make him unable to speak (such as a silence spell or the throat punch ability of the agent class). This does not allow the envoy to speak while he is underwater (or in a similar environment where he cannot breathe) or unconscious.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/envoy#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
